      "created_at": "2023-03-29T14:46:27.397Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Plague Rat is lurking inside Freedom Tower and it’s up to Freedom  Six Tachyon, Parse, K.N.Y.F.E and Akah’Thriya to deal with the infection.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/2/23ef84f50816d62b69033db5143594d7469551f8.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/23ef84f50816d62b69033db5143594d7469551f8\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/2/23ef84f50816d62b69033db5143594d7469551f8_2_231x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"57TSwaqd9NQD4HNhEbh1wuDsnOM\" width=\"231\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/2/23ef84f50816d62b69033db5143594d7469551f8_2_231x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/2/23ef84f50816d62b69033db5143594d7469551f8_2_346x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/2/23ef84f50816d62b69033db5143594d7469551f8_2_462x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/2/23ef84f50816d62b69033db5143594d7469551f8_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">828×1792 108 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>A very relaxed romp. I honestly dragged this out far longer than I needed to just to enjoy the easy stroll through the halls where all the characters could build up, play fun cards and not worry about Plague Rat. Eventually, I couldn’t hold back my punches any more and the game ended with the heroes well in control.</p>",
