      "created_at": "2023-03-29T23:48:06.809Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I was kind of amazed at how much damage I took considering this was a pretty easy fight. I think the only thing I could have done better was infect Harpy first instead of AZ, no idea why I did that.</p>",
